OL,3,GNEWSAFilm shares 'rich tapestry' of
OL,4,AWindrush children's lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe untold stories of children born
OL,7,Ffrom the Windrush generation have
OL,8,Fbecome the centrepiece of a
OL,9,Fdocumentary.
OL,11,FFirst Born Second: Voices of the
OL,12,FChildren of the Windrush Era focuses on
OL,13,Fseven Bristol voices on what it meant
OL,14,Fto grow up black and British in the
OL,15,F1970s and 1980s.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
